    "by": "claude",
    "date": "2026-11-17",
    "note": "Build script compiles ring's C/assembly with cc (nasm only in ring's own pregenerate mode). 17 prebuilt COFF objects in pregenerated/ (Windows x86/x86_64, NASM output of ring's perlasm): their external symbols are only RtlVirtualUnwind (SEH unwinding) and ring's own bn_sqr8x_internal - no other call out; used only for Windows targets. include_bytes! of PKCS#8 templates and test keys. .cargo_vcs_info marks the publish tree dirty (upstream's release practice). No YARA threat. 17 native file(s) as described; checksum = crates.io's; published by briansmith on 2025-03-11."
   },
